# Agent worktrees. These are git worktrees of THIS repo, so they must never be
# tracked: committing one records a gitlink (mode 160000) that behaves like a
# submodule nobody registered, which is how five of them ended up in the index
# and why removing a worktree then showed up as a deletion to commit.
.claude/worktrees/
